&lt;p&gt;We started a movement in which everyone can win – shoppers, retailers, society and every person on our team. To play fair, trust people and reward them for doing the right thing. We see and feel the impact of our work as more and more people gain financial freedom and retailers grow across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2014 in Sydney, Australia, Afterpay has over 24 million active customers globally and more than 250,000 of the best retailers around the world including&amp;nbsp; DSW, Finish Line, Levi’s, Primark, and M&amp;amp;S,and many others.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Afterpay, and now Clearpay in the UK, are helping people spend responsibly! We empower customers to access the things they want and need, while still allowing them to maintain financial wellness and control, by splitting payments in four, for both online and in-store purchases. Clearpay is deeply committed to delivering positive outcomes for customers. Now under the Block ecosystem, we are focused on supporting our community of shoppers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We trust in the next generation and share a vision of a more accessible and sustainable world in which people are rewarded for doing the right thing. Join a movement in which everyone can win.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Head of Mid Market and Enterprise Sales, you will join a successful dynamic team. We are looking for a passionate, and committed outbound Account Executive to engage and sell Clearpay to Mid Market merchants across the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outbound prospect via email and phone to generate new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the entire sales funnel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate conversations with senior executives and business owners at target accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong pipeline of opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the metrics and key value propositions that will drive mutually beneficial contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly demonstrate our USP&#39;s over and above our competitors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and close long term contracts that benefit both Clearpay and our partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable to your target and demonstrate control of your opportunities through pipeline management and CRM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use defined sales methodology to progress opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal stakeholders from sales leadership to marketing through to finance to define contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full cycle sales and closing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering or exceeding targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can demonstrate success in a 360 sales role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience of selling at senior executive level and above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working with e-commerce, payments, fintech or retail verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A level of formal sales and negotiation training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about people, business, and can inspire this passion in others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in seeking out and implementing feedback, and dedication to the improvement of your craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tenacity and an ability to adapt to new situations quickly and think on your feet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent collaboration and communication skills that help you connect with customers by email and phone to establish trust and credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to drive deals independently in a fast-paced, dynamic environment Business development experience (e.g. hunting and cold calling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and team player mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior Salesforce experience or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Professional Services organization at Miro is focused on ensuring our Enterprise customers achieve exceptional outcomes through the Innovation Workspace. Our team of strategic advisors, implementation experts, and forward deployed consultants work side-by-side with customers to transform how they collaborate, build, and innovate—powered by agentic AI and Miro&#39;s world-class platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Consultant, Manufacturing, you will apply AI solutions to transform and automate the core operating processes of leading industrial enterprises. You will engage directly with C-level executives, help them identify high-impact opportunities, build and test enterprise-grade AI solutions on their own data and systems, and drive measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of strategy, operations, and technology. You will be paired with an Account Executive against named accounts—hunting for problems worth solving, then proving they can be solved. Generalist FDCs lead client discussions across industries; as the Manufacturing Specialist, you are the dedicated depth they bring in when a pursuit turns on industrial expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Agenda:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior executives—COO, Chief Supply Chain Officer, Chief Digital Officer, VP Manufacturing, VP Quality—to define an AI transformation agenda Miro can attach to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the initial CxO conversation that creates awareness of what AI makes possible for the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify opportunities before committing to a Validation Sprint: sponsor authority, commitment, and the account&#39;s potential to become a multi-year, seven-figure relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validation Sprints:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-author the Sprint charter with the AE: the business problem, its value, our approach, exit criteria, and the partnership proposal that follows success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the Sprint end to end—immerse, prioritise, build, read out—developing and testing the solution on the customer&#39;s real data and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take manufacturing processes apart and rebuild them on AI-first principles across five workflows: new product development and gate review, quality and continuous improvement, portfolio and program management, operations and launch readiness, and process development and transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build using Miro&#39;s AI Workflows, Prototypes, and Goals, Roadmaps &amp;amp; Delivery capabilities, extended through Miro&#39;s API, WebSDK, and MCP integrations into ERP, PLM, MES, and quality systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value and Conversion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn Sprint outcomes into a business value story, ROI model, and KPI baseline—grounded in metrics the customer already runs on: gate cycle time, requirement coverage at gate, defect recurrence, cost of poor quality, capacity utilisation, on-time launch rate, ramp-to-full-rate time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support executive leadership in delivering the Value Story read-out to the sponsor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-own with the AE the conversion of Sprint outcomes into the partnership proposal and commercial approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the scope of Professional Services involvement post-sale and hand over cleanly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package what you learn and radiate it—internally to Sales, Marketing, and Product, and externally through thought leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in &lt;strong&gt;top-tier consulting, forward deployed engineering, solution consulting, or enterprise transformation&lt;/strong&gt;, weighted toward manufacturing and industrial environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of &lt;strong&gt;manufacturing operating processes&lt;/strong&gt;: NPI and stage-gate/APQP, engineering change management, quality systems (FMEA, 8D, PPAP), S&amp;amp;OP and production planning, lean and continuous improvement, maintenance and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with the &lt;strong&gt;industrial enterprise stack&lt;/strong&gt;—ERP (SAP or equivalent), PLM (Teamcenter, Windchill, 3DEXPERIENCE), MES, quality management systems—and where the data lives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credibility with &lt;strong&gt;COO, Chief Supply Chain Officer, VP Operations, VP Quality&lt;/strong&gt;, and Plant General Manager stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional &lt;strong&gt;GenAI&lt;/strong&gt; skills: Miro, Cursor, Claude Code and Cowork, ChatGPT, Google and Microsoft suites, &lt;strong&gt;MCP&lt;/strong&gt; integrations, prompt and context engineering. You can &lt;strong&gt;build working solutions yourself&lt;/strong&gt; and orchestrate an AI Engineer when the build demands it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build a &lt;strong&gt;before/after value story&lt;/strong&gt; with financial and ROI analysis that survives finance scrutiny&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;business-problem-first&lt;/strong&gt; rather than product-first mindset, and the curiosity to take any process apart&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort in both the boardroom and the plant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who operates independently and under ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to &lt;strong&gt;travel&lt;/strong&gt; to customer sites up to 40%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want you to feel supported, connected, and ready to grow. Our global benefits package generally includes equity, a wellbeing benefit, a WFH equipment allowance, and an annual Learning &amp;amp; Development stipend. Join a diverse team where you can do your best work. Full benefits may differ per location. If you would like to learn more about location-specific benefits, please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/app/board/uXjVG8Fi8Yc=/?moveToWidget=3458764661021134968&amp;amp;cot=10&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Global Miro benefits board&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: #f9f6f0;&quot;&gt;#LI-JM2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Miro&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Miro is a visual workspace for innovation that enables distributed teams of any size to build the next big thing. The platform&#39;s infinite canvas enables teams to lead engaging workshops and meetings, design products, brainstorm ideas, and more. Miro, co-headquartered in San Francisco and Amsterdam, serves more than 100M users and 250,000 companies collaborate in the Innovation Workspace. Miro was founded in 2011 and currently has more than 1,600 employees in 13 hubs around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are a team of dreamers. We look for individuals who dream big, work hard, and above all stay humble. Collaboration is at the heart of what we do and through our work together we hope to create a supportive, welcoming, and innovative environment. We strive to play as a team to win the world and create a better version of ourselves every day. If this sounds like something that excites you, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out more about life at Miro:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Youtube:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Blog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Instagram: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/mirohq/&quot;&gt;https://www.instagram.com/mirohq/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Miro, we strive to create and foster an environment of belonging and collaboration across cultural differences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Miro’s mission — &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Empower teams to create the next big thing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; — is how we think about our product, people, and culture. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We believe that creating big things requires diverse and inclusive teams. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; invites all talent with different demography, identities and styles &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;to step in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; invites them to step &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;closer together. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, we are working to build a more diverse Miro, cultivate a sense of belonging for future and current Mironeers around the world, and foster an environment where everyone can collaborate and embrace differences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Miro handles and uses personal data of job applicants in line with its &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; found &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;PlayStation Studios is the game development division of Sony PlayStation and is responsible for developing some of the most recognisable and ambitious console games and franchises on PlayStation, including The Last of Us, Horizon, Spider-Man, God of War, Helldivers and Gran Turismo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work with some of the best game studios in the world, and use data to help them make their games even better. We provide end-to-end analytics services for PlayStation Studios and use data to help them in the game development lifecycle. We are looking for talented people to join us in pushing the boundaries of game analytics for PlayStation games.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers a flexible hybrid working arrangement, with most time spent working remotely unless you prefer to come into the office. We attend the office for key moments that matter, such as important team meetings, collaboration sessions and business activities where in-person engagement is beneficial.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Data Engineer, you’ll work in our cross-disciplinary Data Platform team to ingest and process high-volume data.&amp;nbsp; You’ll work closely with our Game Analytics analysts and analytics engineers, who use this data to gain valuable insights both during game development and post-launch.&amp;nbsp; As a lead, you’ll scale our platform and help us define its technical direction, expand its reach, and help define and build the future of analytics for PlayStation games.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own parts of our pipeline, and drive improvements to achieve our technical and business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build supporting services for our pipeline, for example working on integrations with in-game maps and video tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate our data collection platform and our BI tools to enable studio self-service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Devops team, our analytics engineers, and stakeholders across the studio business group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on improving data quality, lineage and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support our existing tooling, improving quality and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a technical expert and share than knowledge with your colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building and owning Data Pipelines for high-throughput streaming and batch data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are adept at writing code in Go or write Python with a willingness to learn Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are experienced in building robust, scalable, and resilient services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can demonstrate measurable impact that you have made in your current and previous roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy solving data problems, and can take responsibility for quality, investigations and remediation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud data services.&amp;nbsp; We use AWS data and analytics services, such as Amazon S3, Redshift, Kinesis, Data Firehose, Athena and AWS Glue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has made use of AI during the development cycle, including use of Claude Code, Codex or other harnesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with near real-time data processing, querying and visualisation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Omni Analytics, or a similar BI tool (Looker, Tableau etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GitHub and GitHub Actions experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
